{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449620/extras/24FPS__1_.gif?t=1745502300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This is our first demo released on April 2025. The demo and full game will be changed to incorporate the feedback from the demo.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Funguys Swarm is a survivor game with roguelite elements! Play as Funguys, the protector of the forests and fight the fire king minions. Level up, unlock more heroes, pets, skills and even mecha to get stronger. Save other forest creatures and build up the Forest Sanctuary that will give you even more advantage in the battle. Funguy swarm is Perfect for both newcomers and seasoned players!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Playable Character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Arena</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449620?t=1745502300","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449620?t=1745502300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449620/d05ce845db1de88b2448ce729eba7608a6b88ddd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745502300","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449620/d05ce845db1de88b2448ce729eba7608a6b88ddd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745502300","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.s